cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "tricycle-py: a Python port of the R package tricycle"
message: >-
  This software is a port. Cite the original tricycle paper, listed under
  references, in any work that uses it. Cite this port as well if you wish.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Greene
    given-names: Jacob
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/jacob-greene/tricycle-py"
abstract: >-
  Infers a continuous cell cycle position from single-cell RNA-seq by
  projecting log-normalised expression onto a fixed reference cell cycle
  embedding. A function-by-function Python port of the R/Bioconductor package
  tricycle 1.12.0, working natively on AnnData.
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - cell cycle
  - scRNA-seq
  - anndata
